ms stad. 8 mars 2021. Arkiverad från <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://foretagsservice.stockholm/hitta-idrottsanlaggningar-som-bokas/idrottsanlaggning/stockholms-stadion/\">originalet</a>&#32;den 3 mars 2021<span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210303205613/https://foretagsservice.stockholm/hitta-idrottsanlaggningar-som-bokas/idrottsanlaggning/stockholms-stadion/\">https://web.archive.org/web/20210303205613/https://foretagsservice.stockholm/hitta-idrottsanlaggningar-som-bokas/idrottsanlaggning/stockholms-stadion/</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 6 januari 2023</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.btitle=Stockholms+stadion&amp;rft.atitle=&amp;rft.date=8+mars+2021&amp;rft.pub=Stockholms+stad&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fweb.archive.org%2Fweb%2F20210303205613%2Fhttps%3A%2F%2Fforetagsservice.stockholm%2Fhitta-idrottsanlaggningar-som-bokas%2Fidrottsanlaggning%2Fstockholms-stadion%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info:sid/en.wikipedia.org:Damallsvenskan&#95;2023\"><span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r58662249\" /><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"web\" id=\"CITEREFModess\">Modess, Marie.&#32;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ifkmalmo.se/ga-pa-match/malmo-ip/\">”Malmö IP”</a><span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.ifkmalmo.se/ga-pa-match/malmo-ip/\">https://www.ifkmalmo.se/ga-pa-match/malmo-ip/</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 6 januari 2023</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3